      "name": "InitializeStateCallbackAndData",
      "signature": "void InitializeStateCallbackAndData(void * pfnStateCallback, uint dwGameStateData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initialize game state callback function pointer and data value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Accept callback function pointer via ECX register (__fastcall)\n2. Accept game state data value via EDX register (__fastcall)\n3. Store callback function pointer in global g_pfnStateCallback\n4. Store game state data value in global g_dwGameStateData\n5. Return to caller immediately\n\nParameters:\npfnStateCallback (IMPLICIT via ECX) - Function pointer callback invoked for game state transitions\ndwGameStateData (IMPLICIT via EDX) - Game state data value stored for global use\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value; function only initializes globals for later callback invocation",
